        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978350/extras/0eb2d71685509134af9dc640990efb26.avif?t=1776539425\" width=630 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in the AirLoveEngine, a dream emulator that provides an immersive recreation of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zooming in/out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities in certain levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 20 different main levels based off REAL dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has its own objective, some levels may not even have any objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most levels feature platforming, puzzles and other unique Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your environment, secret levels may be hidden throughout the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978350/extras/42811650bc4c0e1da8c0ffeba841c4b8.avif?t=1776539425\" width=786 height=802 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra Content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack Menu featuring music from both Henry Tahvonen and Brecken Edwards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Museum (an extra menu featuring cut content, and more!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 3 different endings (and more to come)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legacy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game will continue to receive updates including but not limited to Extra levels, content, and general improvements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978350/extras/f12aca80ee2473b1ee71d948eb1dddcb.avif?t=1776539425\" width=347 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR Support:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game in a brand new, and more immersive way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HTC, Meta, and Valve headsets are all supported</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978350/extras/0eb2d71685509134af9dc640990efb26.avif?t=1776539425\" width=630 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in the AirLoveEngine, a dream emulator that provides an immersive recreation of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zooming in/out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities in certain levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 20 different main levels based off REAL dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has its own objective, some levels may not even have any objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most levels feature platforming, puzzles and other unique Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your environment, secret levels may be hidden throughout the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978350/extras/42811650bc4c0e1da8c0ffeba841c4b8.avif?t=1776539425\" width=786 height=802 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra Content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack Menu featuring music from both Henry Tahvonen and Brecken Edwards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Museum (an extra menu featuring cut content, and more!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 3 different endings (and more to come)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legacy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game will continue to receive updates including but not limited to Extra levels, content, and general improvements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978350/extras/f12aca80ee2473b1ee71d948eb1dddcb.avif?t=1776539425\" width=347 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR Support:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game in a brand new, and more immersive way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HTC, Meta, and Valve headsets are all supported</p></li></ul>",
